# Levels & progress

## Levels

- Canonical files: `src/levels/{addition|subtraction|multiplication|division|mix}/level_N.tres`
- Container metadata + unlocks: `src/common/levels/levels_config.gd`
- Bulk generation: `tools/generate_levels.py` (prefer over hand-editing dozens of `.tres`)
- Ignore legacy `src/levels/level_*.tres` at root
- Missing level file → assert at `LevelsConfig` init — always add file + config entry together

## GameConfig

- Schema: `src/common/game_config_default.gd`
- Difficulty = exported fields on level `.tres` (ops, ranges, speeds, health, questions)
- Do not permanently edit runtime `game_scene/game_config.tres` (overwritten per battle)

## Progress

- Schema: `PDataProgress` → `user://progress.tres`
- All mutations through `ProgressController` (+ migrations via `PDataMigrator`)
- Unlock helpers: `LevelsContainerConditions` in `conditions.gd`
- Settings: `UserSettings` → `user://settings.tres`

## Must

- Keep `container_id` strings stable (progress keys)
- Bump progress `version` + add migration when schema changes
